    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d250">

                <pb facs="0478" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1946v01/pg460"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB/12–1346: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the United States
                        Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-12-13T18:00:00-05:00">December 13,
                            1946—6 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>319. USdel. Dept most anxious that Siam be admitted to membership in UN at this
                    session GA. Please make every effort expedite procedure to this end.<anchor
                        n="65" xml:id="d250-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d250-f1" n="65" xml:id="d250-f1-content">
                <p>The resolution admitting Siam to membership in the United Nations was adopted
                    unanimously by the General Assembly at the last plenary meeting of the Session
                    on December 15 (GA (I/2), <hi rendition="#italic">Plenary</hi>, pp. 1458 and
                    1459).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
